sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant API as OpenAI API Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP<br/>Configurable TLS
    participant Input as Input Processor
    participant Engine as AsyncLLM Engine<br/>ZeroMQ/MsgPack IPC
    participant Scheduler as Scheduler<br/>(Chunked Prefill)
    participant KVCache as KV Cache + Model<br/>(CPU Memory)
    participant Output as Output Processor
    participant HFHub as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Storage as Model Storage<br/>(S3/GCS/PVC)
    participant gRPCClient as gRPC Client
    participant gRPC as gRPC Server<br/>50051/TCP

    Note over API, Engine: Flow 1: OpenAI Chat Completion Request

    Client->>API: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (optional)
    API->>Input: Validate & tokenize request
    Input->>Engine: Submit inference request<br/>(in-process Python)
    Engine->>Scheduler: Schedule batch<br/>(continuous batching)
    Scheduler->>KVCache: Execute model forward pass<br/>(AVX-512/AVX2/BF16 kernels)
    KVCache-->>Scheduler: Token logits
    Scheduler-->>Engine: Generated tokens
    Engine-->>Output: Process output tokens
    Output-->>API: SSE stream chunks
    API-->>Client: HTTP SSE Response<br/>Content-Type: text/event-stream

    Note over Engine, HFHub: Flow 2: Model Loading (Startup)

    Engine->>HFHub: Download model weights<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (HF_TOKEN)<br/>TLS 1.2+
    HFHub-->>Engine: Model artifacts (safetensors)
    Engine->>Storage: OR: Load from S3/GCS/PVC<br/>Various protocols
    Storage-->>Engine: Model weight files
    Engine->>KVCache: Load weights to CPU memory
    Engine->>KVCache: Allocate KV cache blocks

    Note over gRPCClient, Engine: Flow 3: gRPC Inference Request

    gRPCClient->>gRPC: VllmEngine RPC<br/>gRPC (HTTP/2)<br/>No encryption
    gRPC->>Engine: Submit via VllmEngineServicer<br/>(in-process Python)
    Engine-->>gRPC: Streaming tokens
    gRPC-->>gRPCClient: gRPC stream response<br/>HTTP/2 No encryption
